r  make food and snacks for restaurants and  caterers it's really frustrating that we  on one side can't get product and then  on the other side can't get product out  so when we do have product in stock so  it's yeah it's a bit of a nightmare to  be in that now that the sales are there  or while the orders are there we can't  actually fulfill them the government's  recipe is for a home-grown solution  helped by workers coming off furlough  next month but without the drivers who  keep the economy moving the recovery may  be on ice paul kelso sky news in  leicester
 

